# ✅ Exercise 3 - Convert JSX to React.createElement()

## Objective

Understand what JSX becomes after compilation.

### Convert the following JSX

```jsx
<button className="btn" onClick={handleClick}>
  Save
</button>
```

### Expected Output

```javascript
React.createElement(
  "button",
  {
    className: "btn",
    onClick: handleClick,
  },
  "Save"
);
```

### Expected Concepts

- JSX Compilation
- React.createElement()

### Status

- [ ] Completed

